{
    "Name": "http_communications/unified_ssl_pinning_bypass",
    "Description": "Unified Android TLS/pinning bypass with typed Java hooks, preserved certificate chains, diagnostics, and opt-in Flutter native patches.",
    "Help": "One module for Conscrypt, SSLContext/custom trust managers, OkHttp2/3, TrustKit, WebView/RNCWebView/Cordova, PhoneGap/Worklight, Cronet, Flutter plugins/native TLS, Appcelerator, Fabric, Netty, and Appmattus. Stage before other modules that replace TLS methods. Default native mode is off; peer and thumb modes require validation against the exact Flutter engine build. Existing hook conflicts are reported instead of overwritten. Native process crashes still require bridge/runtime diagnosis; reattach explicitly after a process restart.",
